Hi all,

I have updated the babel beta release on
ftp://ftp.uni-mainz.de/pub/tex/macros/latex/required/babel/3.7-beta.
I think most of the problems that were reported with the beta release
are solved now and I want to make this the 'public' release in a couple =
of
weeks.
I would like you all to especially look at the problems you reported
earlier and see if you agree with me that they have been solved.
I don't guarantee I have been able to tackle everything and some unfound
bugs will be lurking in there as well.
So, if you find any problems, please report them via the bugs address:
mailto:latex-bugs@latex-project.org using latexbug.tex
Reporting this way helps me keeping track of what I have done and what
has yet to be attacked.

Kind regrads,

Johannes Braams

